Update MoltenVK to a build that allows 16 descriptor sets

KSA's shaders use descriptor sets 0-9. The MoltenVK in Sikarugir wrappers
(1.4.2) allows 8, so some shaders fail to compile ("cannot reserve 'buffer'
resource location") and the game crashes. SPIRV-Cross raised the limit to 16
in commit 76301541; this MoltenVK is built with a SPIRV-Cross that has it.

Replaces the wrapper's MoltenVK with files/wrapper/Frameworks/libMoltenVK.dylib
from this mod folder, built by .github/workflows/build.yml from:

MoltenVK:    main
SPIRV-Cross: aa217aeb6c9f0ace7a0ab233b28807edf45eb165

Remove once the wrapper ships a MoltenVK with the higher limit.
---
replace wrapper:Frameworks/libMoltenVK.dylib
